episcopo [teste <NOTE N="58" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0631" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0631"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">altera manu post add. in margine</HI>  1.</NOTE> ].</ITEM> <ITEM>46. De Valentiniano imperatore, de monachis, et de
