 <COL N="0631D"></COL> Theodoro episcopo.</ITEM> <ITEM>50. De Arcadio imperatore <NOTE N="59" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0631" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0631"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">prima manu in margine adscriptum
est hoc capitulum</HI>  1.</NOTE> .</ITEM> <ITEM>51. De Honorio imperatore, et testimonio Luciani
