id est ad sextum annum <NOTE N="62" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0631" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0631"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest in textu, post in margine
altera manu additum</HI>  1.</NOTE>  hujus Justiniani,
