sedis, 16. Kal. Januar., ipsoque die pace <NOTE N="521" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="0779" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0779"></COL> pacem  <HI REND="ITALIC">ed. De codd. nihil notatum est.</HI></NOTE>  inter
