salutem necessarius, 484. Ejus administratio sacerdotibus
commissa, 483, 484. Generalis hora nona conferendus, 407.</ITEM> <ITEM>Baptizati in manibus lumen tenent, 62, 138, 139.</ITEM> <ITEM>Barba clericorum radenda, 3, 91, app. 22. Quid designat,
3.</ITEM> <ITEM>Benedictio chrismatis et olei cum ceremoniis, 184. Novi
ignis, 53, 58, 61. Episcopalis in missa ante  <HI REND="ITALIC">Agnus Dei,</HI> 
