residentia, app. 60, 61.</ITEM> <CAPTION COM="1312">C</CAPTION> <ITEM>Calix ad dexteram partem hostiae olim positus, 20, 106.
Corporali olim coopertus, 20, 22, 394. Huic participabant
diaconus et subdiaconus, 24, 109. Eum levabant sacerdos
et diaconus, simul ponebant, et cooperiebant, 22, 108,
394. Illum mundabat diaconus, et quod remanserat ipse
cum subdiacono sumebat, 24, 109. Alius ad mundandos
digitos post communionem ab acolytho delatus, 24. Calicem
et patenam renebat mantili involuta usque ad completionem
