clericis deferenda, non a laicis, 167.</ITEM> <ITEM>Candelas deferunt poenitentes publici in sua reconciliatione,
195.</ITEM> <ITEM>Canonici olim fratres vocati, 7, 10, 11, 12, 47, 252, 254,
266, 284, 290, 294, 294, 315, 316, 320. Eorum est officia
ecclesiastica agere, 4, 98. Trium regum personas exhibebant
